# Typing a long line in a narrow terminal, shrinking the terminal mid-edit and typing on keeps the caret in view and saves the whole text.
size 60 20
file <<END
Work:
	- Report
	- Slides
END
keys j <Enter>
type  and also a very long continuation that goes beyond the width of the pane for sure
see ▌   - ation that goes beyond the width of the pane for sure
resize 40 15
type  END
see the pane for sure END
keys <Esc>
see ▌   - Report and also a very long conti…
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Report and also a very long continuation that goes beyond the width of the pane for sure END
	- Slides
END
